{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9f5c7b1d322233c7d81f1038d3bb25dbcd9db54f6f007df01f548dcddff9c389", "ja": "（仕事が終わり帰路についたが、だいぶ暗くなって\nしまったな。おや？　あそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（工作结束后踏上了回家的路，不知不觉天已经变得很暗了。嗯？那边的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e19caee17643fe8d92fb414ad92d5197a3e123a48a60f03be715b22c6fa0ef77", "ja": "千早？\nどうしたんだ、こんなところにひとりで。", "zh": "千早？\n怎么了，这么晚一个人待在这种地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "bf60066c0f189c50d8ca8800b23b9d7ee458982df0589e7417b3ff2d899da585", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。お疲れさまです。\n星がすごく綺麗だったので……。少し寄り道を。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。辛苦了。\n因为星星特别漂亮……所以稍微绕了点路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d4b787a455f69f32dac4db6508590991f867e30affeb25230d3be5f5a3da0b74", "ja": "星？　……あ。たしかによく見えるな。\n最近忙しくて、全然気付かなかったよ。", "zh": "星星？……啊，确实看得很清楚。\n最近太忙了，完全没注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "f7200b21234a26f2b93008b97f001d98f2b67ed6da613f585945cd3b5e8edc98", "ja": "ふふ、私もです。……よかったら、\n{$P$}も見ていきませんか？", "zh": "呵呵，我也是。……如果你愿意的话，要不要也看看{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fdabaeadf33482ef0138d8d81dc5b084e5e25082303d4dcf6382b61123f0a1b3", "ja": "いいのか？　多分、綺麗だなって感想くらいしか\n出てこないけど……。", "zh": "可以吗？我大概顶多只能说出\n“好漂亮啊”这种感想就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "a79b7ab878a4704c93e3b966e4983d0ead5351c62ea164bf102f5b1365adf353", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ。\nただ眺めるだけでも十分楽しめますし、それに……。", "zh": "没关系的。\n光是静静地眺望就足够让人尽兴了，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "2465642a6147583db0822f1b22ff0fbe2c31506ed8d2bc6b23ff2d0c3d1ac605", "ja": "スマホに星座早見盤のアプリを入れたんです。\n見ながらであれば、すぐに詳しくなれますから。", "zh": "我在手机上下载了星座图的应用。\n只要一边看，就能很快熟悉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b1cefc94978ad3e665a18efd518ae4493340a05343d02ae8607a33f1b96ab1b7", "ja": "はは、準備がいいな。\nじゃあ、お言葉に甘えるとしようかな。", "zh": "哈哈，准备得真周到啊。那我就恭敬不如从命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0412_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0412_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "9722096e51ba3d6da00081939dcaa318f49be8a2276657314575261155e9f4be", "ja": "ふふっ。では、こちらへどうぞ。オリオン座、\nわかりますか？　左上の赤い星がベテルギウスで……。", "zh": "呵呵，那么请往这边来。猎户座，您能认出来吗？左上方那颗红色的星星就是参宿四……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
